SUPERSEDED / CORRECTED 2026-07-31 (klein-S428, MSG-2238).

The earlier output of this file reported the level-3 Bonferroni RHS (m_E - S1 + S2 - S3) as
"positive 100% of 3000 configs". That was a SAMPLING FLUKE (expected failure count < 1 at
N=3000). The RHS is NEGATIVE on explicit defect-7/8/9 witnesses; at N=20000 the route fails on
~6 configs. The Bonferroni INEQUALITY is correct, but its RHS is not a positive quantity, so this
route does NOT prove defect>=7 => gap>3/41. The target L>0 itself SURVIVES (still open, plausible).

See lrc14_defect_ge7_bonferroni_REFUTED_opus_S4.out for the corrected run and the witnesses.
